chunks.text:
[Intro]
{a lone bayan accordion plays the faction motif: a dark 4-note descending minor phrase}
{a deep male choir hums under it, cold wind texture}

[Theme]
{a military snare march starts on the downbeat}
{the low brass states the 4-note motif, strong and slow, the choir answers}

[Ending]
{the motif one last time in half-time by choir and brass}
{then one unison hit on the downbeat and a long natural ring-out; a definitive ending, no fade-out}
